## 二次開發與共同維護 / Forks and co-maintenance

本作品以「可被接手、可被二次開發」為目的發佈；歡迎 fork、修改與共同維護
（見 [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md)）。第三方修改版本由其作者自行負責。

The Work is released to be adopted and extended; forks, modifications and joint
maintenance are welcome (see [CONTRIBUTING.md](CONTRIBUTING.md)). Third-party
modifications are the responsibility of their authors.

